event: content_block_delta
data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/plan-note.md\", \"content\": \"# Plan for csrclkey mission\\n\\nMission: deliver src/greet.py (greet(name) -\u003e \\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\") and\\ntests/test_greet.py (covers a normal name and the empty string), such that\\n`python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exits 0.\\n\\nRepo is currently empty (just README.md).\\n\\nPlan:\\n1. Send dev a single dispatch with the exact mission requirements (file paths,\\n   function signature, return format, test cases, verification command) and\\n   instructions to commit to its own branch and reply honestly.\\n2. Wait for dev's reply.\\n3. Judge by fetching dev's branch (not trusting the reply text): check\\n   src/greet.py exists and implements greet(name) correctly, check\\n   tests/test_greet.py covers a normal name and \\\"\\\" empty-string case, and\\n   actually run `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` myself against the\\n   fetched tree to confirm exit 0.\\n4. Accept if all three criteria hold; otherwise send precise rework.\\n5. Reply to mission m1 with the honest outcome once concluded or the deadline\\n   / stall condition (mission says: small mission, wrap up honestly if it\\n   stalls) is reached.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

